      "title": "The Early Earthworm Catches on to Full Data Release",
      "abstract": "<jats:p>&lt;strong&gt; New research and data published in &lt;em&gt; GigaScience &lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt; PLOS ONE &lt;/em&gt; provides complete open access to detailed 3D images of earthworms &lt;/strong&gt; To quote the American cartoonist Gary Larson: all things play a role in nature, even the lowly worm\u2014but perhaps never in such a visually stunning way as that presented in two papers published last week in &lt;em&gt; GigaScience &lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt; PLOS ONE &lt;/em&gt; . The work and data presented here</jats:p>",
